  "assumptions": [
   "Power: about 450 per arm to detect 0.027 at 80% power; sized to detect a 0.03 label-vs-guide gap (H1 SD about 0.13). Observed Guide-vs-control raw difference 0.006, adjusted 0.047.",
   "Recruit about 600 per arm to allow for attrition at the 1-week follow-up.",
   "Per-post responses are recorded in the feed platform (24 posts, one judgment each) so d' and criterion can be computed; the single judgment question stands in for each post.",
   "Wave 2 uses a new set of 24 posts with the same arm and, for labelled arms, labels; the guide is not re-shown.",
   "Platform: online panel; about 10 minutes at wave 1, 5 minutes at wave 2."
  ],
  "unresolved": [
   "The actual media files, labels and guide must be supplied by the research team.",
   "IRB approval number and compensation need to be set.",
   "The wave 2 invitation and recontact procedure must be built."
